{"id":"7ed23faee951231d","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-turing-reducibility.md","title":"Turing Reducibility","display":"df-turing-reducibility — Turing Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-turing-reducibility","aliases":["68-df-turing-reducibility"],"display":"df-turing-reducibility — Turing Reducibility","depends_on":["[[68-df-oracle-computation]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§12 pp.39-43 / PDF 48-52; §15 p.53 / PDF 62","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-turing-reducibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-turing-reducibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-reducibility — Turing Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12 pp.39-43 / PDF 48-52; §15 p.53 / PDF 62"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^B\">\\(\\varphi_e^B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 与其严格部分 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_T\">\\(&lt;_T\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_e^B(x)\\downarrow\\ \\land\\ \\varphi_e^B(x)=\\chi_A(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_T B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_e^B(x)\\downarrow\\ \\land\\ \\varphi_e^B(x)=\\chi_A(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A&lt;_T B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T B\\land\\neg(B\\le_T A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A&lt;_T B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T B\\land\\neg(B\\le_T A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用本目录 χ 的 1 为真约定。左端 A 是待判定集合，右端 B 是 oracle，修正旧 Hypothesis 中互换的说明。对应原书全函数相对递归关系，经集合表示函数限制得到此接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[6