-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。"},{"id":"fcd2a2bd1b358916","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages]] 唯一确定的阶段数据 $C_s$、$\\mathrm{FMAct}$、$\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}$ 及极限集合 $A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}$。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]；$\\mathrm{FinInjury}$ 见 [[68-df-finite-injury]]；$\\mathrm{RE}$、$\\le_T$、$\\Phi_e^D$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]、[[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$\\chi_D$ 沿用该 oracle 接口的集合表示函数。有限查询保持使用 [[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"0cca9651cac638c4","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。集合构造与稳定性论证见 [[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction]]。"},{"id":"87e145f3544aae62","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\le_T,<_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]；跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]；$\\mathrm{RE}^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]。"},{"id":"3a9f1c3bbe45ef77","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce5ab33aceacb17e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{RecApprox}(g,A)$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-limit-approximation]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。"},{"id":"72b4a1b9eac21c78","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PostProblem}$ 见 [[68-df-post-problem]]，$\\mathrm{Int}$ 见 [[68-df-intermediate-degree]]；$\\mathr